                                "sense_id": "26b3c020-7f92-39c5-a779-eab5d8cbd1c0",
                                "text": "Some forty-five li south of Qian Kou is the market town of Bai Dao Kou. Fifteen li to the west is Dao Kou town, the capital of Hua County, Henan Province."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f855c053-e424-4b0f-8765-eeef5f7cbbdf",
                                "sense_id": "26b3c020-7f92-39c5-a779-eab5d8cbd1c0",
                                "text": "A native of Hua County, Henan Province, Nie joined the CCP in 1938."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "884f3170-67a4-46fb-9f3b-929fec4e7edf",
                                "sense_id": "26b3c020-7f92-39c5-a779-eab5d8cbd1c0",
                                "text": "Serum samples were separated from blood samples by centrifugation and tested for HCV in the Anyang Cancer Hospital for case-patients from Anyang, Lin, and Tangyin counties, and in the Hua County Hospital for case-patients from Hua County."
